---------------------------------------
Add before the push step:
    - uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@0.28.0
      with:
        image-ref: ${{ secrets.DOCKERHUB_USERNAME }}/myapp:${{ env.TAG }}
        severity: CRITICAL,HIGH
        exit-code: "1"
(This needs the image built first: build with push: false + load:
true, scan, then push. Check the trivy-action README for the current
